2026-08-22T02:04:04.4430166Z [36;1m# Do NOT export UserNM here, however tempting the `UserNM=true` trick[0m
2026-08-22T02:04:04.4430644Z [36;1m# from AGENTS.md looks. It is a development shortcut, not a CI setting.[0m
2026-08-22T02:04:04.4431001Z [36;1m#[0m
2026-08-22T02:04:04.4431218Z [36;1m# R takes the nm program from $UserNM in[0m
2026-08-22T02:04:04.4431601Z [36;1m# tools:::read_symbols_from_object_file, and that function serves two[0m
2026-08-22T02:04:04.4432188Z [36;1m# callers, not one: building `symbols.rds` at install time (which[0m
