2026-08-22T02:22:33.3525734Z Skipping the duckdb test suite.
2026-08-22T02:22:33.3525896Z 
2026-08-22T02:22:33.3526170Z The duckdb tests exercise DuckDB's bundled C++ engine and are deliberately
2026-08-22T02:22:33.3526699Z NOT run on CRAN. They run automatically on GitHub Actions (including
2026-08-22T02:22:33.3527202Z r-universe). This keeps check time and resource usage on CRAN within
2026-08-22T02:22:33.3527731Z acceptable limits and helps release duckdb in a predictable and controlled
2026-08-22T02:22:33.3528095Z manner.
2026-08-22T02:22:33.3528222Z 
2026-08-22T02:22:33.3528490Z This is intentional, not an oversight. duckdb has an extensive test suite
2026-08-22T02:22:33.3529336Z that runs continuously in our own CI; see <https://github.com/duckdb/duckdb-r>.
2026-08-22T02:22:33.3529652Z 
